    "immutable": true,
    "currentCallWillRefuseSupersededBytes": true
  },
  "parentAction": "Root must couple exactly six before/current-after identities with authenticated installation/new current proof. Preserve old169 receipt/verifier/source history and use a narrowly named historical validator/capsule for it; do not rewrite its fingerprints or broaden generic fallbacks. Runtime proofs bind accepted stage source; doc adapters need source-only identities plus new installed proof. No root script edits supplied here.",
  "futureRequired": [
    "Independent accepted epoch, exact public aliases/manifests and license22 source map.",
    "Installation receipt exact17 target before/after rows; app41 before and additions absent, current shared dependencies separately captured.",
    "Current focused source roster/TAP/original private observations with adapted-helper acquisition counts separated.",
    "Old receipt/source fingerprints and six byte-exact inverse transitions; nontransition source rows remain strict.",
    "Original159 source ID/SHA and232 capability IDs unchanged."
  ]
}
