notes='''# Notes36 source installation proposal

This is a source-only proposal. It has not installed files or accepted current36 behavior. The seven application after-images are the exact corrected R5 sources accepted in the distinct experimental111/8 runs at89e andd24. The17 pre-existing test files, frozen old32 helpers/composer/collectors and every historical receipt remain unchanged.

Installation must copy the reviewed application, declaration, new current36 helper/collector/workflow, migration, producer/controls and paired old-workflow transition atomically. The two old automatic contracts require their historical32 baseline; their complete original workflows are preserved and their manual jobs remain unchanged. The new automatic workflow validates the actual committed36-source app without overlays. Retiring triggers alone is forbidden.

The new current proof is60 objects under64/8MiB, with an external literal declaration pin and only the other59 identities inside the declaration. Historical52 logical sources retain52 explicit physical paths; three changed app paths read their exact prior snapshots. The separate old installed tooling yields a historical56-row envelope. Current tooling is exactly12 fixed rows; the collector self is a distinct95th publication role. The producer must verify94 files before the workflow adds its one attempt record, yielding95 under the unchanged96 cap. Common159/160 and Archive94/96 remain separate budgets.

All208 prior control semantics are retained with explicit current-versus-historical route expectations. The98 additional source/provenance/role controls make306 planned checks. None has run as part of this proposal. Fresh hosted installed111/21 finite and8 browser acceptance, both independent source postchecks, actual full-suite roster/count and publication306/95 evidence with recoverable backups remain required. The forecast1119 full groups must never be described as observed from arithmetic.

The actual installation journal does not exist yet. The root copy must independently record every before identity/absence, readable before backup, actual after readback and protected source check. The new helper and collector authenticate source/Git provenance; they do not authenticate that journal or perform installation. The frozen app README retains historical proposal wording; a future actual journal and acceptance evidence must state the installation epoch separately.

The d24 full-suite1098/1100 result remains failed evidence. A later instrumented native diagnostic is a distinct observation and does not establish its retrospective cause. Before any source copy, the parent must assess the current e655 full-suite gate outcome and review the complete integration. The unresolved historical cause is preserved explicitly; no speculative runtime fix or limit change is proposed. No parity or superiority claim follows from source review or focused experimental acceptance.
'''
