browser_source=once(browser_source,"  scope: notesScope ?", "  scope: notesInstalledScope ? 'Eight unchanged real Chromium Notes cases on clean committed32-file Notes sources and8 exact after pins. Requires full six-directory Git census, independent always Notes/browser postchecks, four actual response holds, two raw downloads, eight PNGs and eight complete cleanups. No source overlay, original full application/GUI, full-suite, security, parity or superiority acceptance; frozen README remains proposal-epoch documentation.' : notesScope ?")
