doc='''# Current36 committed Notes collector/workflow proposal

Only the new collector and new workflow are owned by this proposal. No application, declaration, helper, migration, producer, controls, historical workflow or active repository path was changed. Root/independent full source peer and the separately reviewed atomic source installation are required before hosted execution. No candidate import, syntax check, test or build ran locally.

The new workflow uses the approved current36 helper's before/after interface, exact clean committed sources and independent always-attempted postchecks. Every eligible active source must match Git; there are no source overlays or excluded targets. It does not authenticate an actual source installation journal or perform source installation. The frozen historical R5 declaration keeps its proposal language.

The exact twelve tooling roles are helper, current declaration, this new workflow, unchanged R5 spec/config/roster, shared acquisition, package/lock/browser metadata, default config and Flow/Vault spec. The collector self is separately Git-bound; publication must pin/capture it as the separate95th role, never a thirteenth tooling row. The helper owns60 proof paths. Workflow source contains the collector path but no collector hash, avoiding an identity cycle.

All R5 finite/browser/original-comparison validators remain exact apart from their local installation object name, own finite observation output filename and equivalent current36 declaration source array. The111 finite groups across21 files,23+19 required names, separate20/4/2 helper counts, eight real Chromium cases, three successful and one failed genuine-response holds, two restored genuine filesystem faults, two downloads, eight PNGs/cleanups and all native JEX/resource/canonical identity checks remain mandatory. Only GITHUB_JOB is projected from the helper's ten execution fields to compare with the existing nine-field acquisition receipt.

The workflow has two distinct jobs with the original exact job names, pinned Windows/Node/actions, owned external evidence/browser cache and bounded2500-file/96MiBraw/8MiBindividual/15MiBZIP preservation. Storage fallback is explicitly incomplete and cannot earn acceptance. Its trigger paths include both old workflow identities for atomic transition provenance; retiring their automatic triggers belongs to the Notes implementation author. Fresh current36 installed111/8, full-suite and current-payload publication evidence remain pending. Full product replacement/superiority are not claimed.
'''
(STAGE/'README.md').write_text(doc,encoding='utf-8',newline='')
