  s=replace(s,'A separate hosted diagnostic is being prepared with the same runtime deadline and assertions.','A separate instrumented [diagnostic run `38938239800`](https://github.com/Ginderlax/rea-research-lab/actions/runs/38938239800) passes its five unchanged checks and records six successful native calls from two workers under the same runtime deadline and assertions. It does not reproduce or diagnose D24.')
  old='Committed Notes task editing separately passes **92/92 groups and eight browser scenarios** on its recorded 32-file source epoch. The New To-do **111/111 and eight-scenario** result below remains an experiment; its 36-file source is not installed. Current publication verification passes all **208 controls, both root phases and 963 syntax checks**, with 92 readable artifact files and 56 authenticated Notes-envelope sources. The exact two derived metadata files were imported at `089cb234`; its automatic repeat confirms the same canonical payload and manifest. These later preservation and documentation changes need fresh publication validation. Complete-product parity and superiority remain unproven.'
  new='The reviewed **36-file Notes New To-do source is now installed**, as tracked in the [separate source transition](products/rea-studio/results/notes36-source-transition-20261016/installation-plan.json). **Fresh installed acceptance is pending**: 111 finite groups across 21 fixed files, eight real Chromium cases, independent source postchecks, the full implemented-suite superset and 306 publication controls require actual results for this installed epoch. The new automatic workflow validates committed sources without overlays. The historical 32-file Notes result remains **92/92 groups and eight browser scenarios** on its own source; the separately composed 111/8 result below is experimental evidence, not an installed pass. The historical D24/089c publication result remains **208 controls, both root phases and 963 syntax checks**, with 92 readable artifact files and 56 Notes-envelope sources. The current producer instead requires 95 exact artifact roles under the unchanged 96-file cap. The two derived metadata paths are unchanged by source installation and require fresh hosted validation before a later import. Complete-product parity and superiority remain unproven.'
  s=replace(s,old,new)
  s=replace(s,'This is accepted experimental evidence. Installing the 36-file candidate into the normal Notes application requires a separate source-proof transition and fresh installed checks. The installed 32-file application and its 92/8 evidence remain unchanged; counts are never added together.','This remains accepted experimental evidence at its original source epoch. Its exact seven application after-images have now been installed through the separate current36 source-proof transition; fresh installed checks remain pending. The older 32-file source and its 92/8 receipts are preserved as historical epochs; counts are never added together. The frozen application README retains its original experimental proposal wording and is qualified by the current source transition.')
 elif p=='CLOUD-VERIFICATION.md':
  s=replace(s,'The latest completed full-suite repeat is','The preserved pre-Notes36 full-suite repeat is')
  s=replace(s,'A separate hosted diagnostic is being prepared to record the native transport outcome under the unchanged command, deadline and test assertions.','A separate instrumented [diagnostic run `38938239800`](https://github.com/Ginderlax/rea-research-lab/actions/runs/38938239800) passes all five unchanged selected checks. Its complete 78-file backup authenticates all 70 fixed sources and the independent postcheck, with two worker traces containing six successful native callbacks and zero native errors under the unchanged command, deadline and assertions. The new observation does not reproduce or identify D24\'s original cause.')
  s=replace(s,'The earlier installed-Notes, Archive and full-suite records below retain their exact source epochs. New To-do\'s separately accepted 111/8 experimental result is still uninstalled; it is not added to the installed 92 groups, eight browser cases or full-suite total.','The reviewed Notes New To-do source is now installed as a distinct **36-file committed-source epoch**, described by its [source installation plan](products/rea-studio/results/notes36-source-transition-20261016/installation-plan.json). Its new automatic [current36 workflow](.github/workflows/notes-new-todo-installed-cloud.yml) uses no source overlays and requires all 36 Notes Git identities, seven target pins and a closed 60-object source proof before and after each job. **Fresh installed acceptance remains pending**: 111/111 finite groups in 21 fixed files, the same eight real browser cases, independent postchecks, the actual full-suite superset and all 306 publication controls must be observed on this new source epoch. The producer must close 95 artifact roles: 94 before the workflow adds its one attempt record, under the unchanged 96-file cap. Current tooling is exactly 12 rows; the collector self is a separate literal-pinned Git source. Historical52/56, common159/160 and Archive94/96 budgets stay separate. The earlier installed32, Archive and full-suite records below retain their exact source epochs; experimental111/8 and historical92/8 are never added together or relabeled as this new installed pass.')
  s=replace(s,'The reviewed **Notes task-editing sources are installed and pass fresh committed-source checks**.','The historical **32-file Notes task-editing epoch was installed and passed its own committed-source checks**.')
  s=replace(s,'The broader implemented suite now passes as recorded below; the successful 208-control publication result is recorded below.','Its historical implemented-suite and 208-control publication results are recorded below. They do not accept the later current36 installation. The exact R5 application README remains a frozen experimental proposal epoch; the current source transition qualifies that historical wording.')
 else:
  value=json.loads(s)
  value['phase']='notes36-sources-installed-fresh-acceptance-pending-native-metadata-failure-unresolved'
  value['next_required_milestone']='Collect fresh installed current36 finite111/21 and browser8 results with both independent source postchecks, the actual full implemented-suite superset, all306 publication controls and exact95-role recoverable evidence under unchanged budgets. Keep D24 full1098/1100 failure unresolved; the separate instrumented five-check diagnostic did not reproduce its cause. Preserve all historical32, experimental111/8 and older full/publication epochs. Continue all remaining documented features and whole-product comparisons.'
  value['implemented_milestone']='The exact corrected R5 seven-source after-images are now installed in the36-file Notes application with a separately versioned current36 source-proof/collector/workflow transition. Fresh installed111/8, full-suite and publication306 acceptance remain pending; no experimental or historical receipt is rebound. The preserved089c full repeat passes1100/1100; D24 full1098/1100 failed2 Archive native-metadata groups and its cause remains unknown. A separate instrumented diagnostic passes5/5 with6 successful native calls, not a retrospective diagnosis. Earlier installed32 Notes92/8 and composed New To-do111/8 retain their actual source scopes. All10 complete replacement and superiority gates remain open.'
  value['notes36_source_installation']={
   'status':'source-installed-fresh-hosted-acceptance-pending',
   'sourceTransitionPlan':'results/notes36-source-transition-20261016/installation-plan.json',
   'currentNotesSources':36,'sourceTargetsInstalled':7,'sourceOverlay':False,'currentProofObjects':60,'currentProofFileLimit':64,'fixedToolingRows':12,'collectorSelfIsSeparate':True,
